                ^"Frosty Breath of the Spoken Lie" TECHNIQUE "Intellego" FORM "Mentem" LEVEL 20 CASTING_TOTAL 21
                ^"Peering Into the Mortal Mind" TECHNIQUE "Intellego" FORM "Mentem" LEVEL 30 CASTING_TOTAL 21
            }
            CHOICES {
                "If the Guernicus lies (says something she believes to be untrue as if it were true), she cannot use any magic until the sun next rises or sets. Anyone who wants to tell a lie in her presence soon after she casts a spell (within two minutes or so) must make a relevant Personality Trait check against an Ease Factor equal to the magnitude of the spell cast. If the check fails, he cannot bring himself to lie, although he can remain silent. The Guernicus could take four more points of Flaws, and corresponding Virtues."
            }
        }

